  "details": "\r\n<p>In the<em> Barrington Atlas</em>,&nbsp;an association between the area of&nbsp;Castronuovo di Sicilia and the location of the ancient settlement of Krastos is suggested (although with a question mark). However, Manni 1981 does not support this theory and sees Castronuovo as a probable location for the ancient Petra instead. The <em>BTCGI</em> labels Krastos as an \"unidentified place\".</p>\r\n",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A modern location in Sicily that has been associated with the location of the ancient settlement of Krastos.",
